{"end_line": 520, "evidence_id": "aidl:502-520", "line": 502, "lines": ["    /**", "     * Current gear. In non-manual case, selected gear may not", "     * match the current gear. For example, if the selected gear is GEAR_DRIVE,", "     * the current gear will be one of GEAR_1, GEAR_2 etc, which reflects", "     * the actual gear the transmission is currently running in.", "     *", "     * Values in the config data must represent the list of supported gears", "     * for this vehicle.  For example, config data for an automatic transmission", "     * must contain {GEAR_NEUTRAL, GEAR_REVERSE, GEAR_PARK, GEAR_1, GEAR_2,...}", "     * and for manual transmission the list must be", "     * {GEAR_NEUTRAL, GEAR_REVERSE, GEAR_1, GEAR_2,...}. This list need not be the", "     * same as that of the supported gears reported in GEAR_SELECTION.", "     *", "     * @change_mode VehiclePropertyChangeMode.ON_CHANGE", "     * @access VehiclePropertyAccess.READ", "     * @data_enum VehicleGear", "     */", "    CURRENT_GEAR = 0x0401 + 0x10000000 + 0x01000000", "            + 0x00400000, // VehiclePropertyGroup:SYSTEM,VehicleArea:GLOBAL,VehiclePropertyType:INT32"], "source_id": "aidl"}
